              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DTH2VANGOGHSEAR"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love the taste of this recipe (although I left out the sugar) and it's very easy to make, but it seems *really* wet and soupy to me. Are the canned tomatoes supposed to be drained first?",
            "datePublished": "2006-11-24T07:21:25.273Z"
